    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. can you dig a bit deeper into the management aspect? you mentioned Sub-Saharan Africa needs more \"intensive, on-the-ground management\"—is that due to specific cultural differences in how people approach professional discipline or just general infrastructure issues? i'm trying to figure out if the \"unreliability\" is a skill gap or more about the mindset of the workers there compared to the European teams.",
