      "content": "that's helpful. so if we're talking about the \"mindset\" aspect, would you say there's a fundamental difference in the baseline level of professional discipline between these regions? like, if we're comparing a worker in Poland vs a worker in Nigeria, is it safe to assume the Polish worker is inherently more suited for high-precision roles that require autonomy, whereas the Nigerian workforce would always need that extra layer of supervision to stay on track? just trying to see if we can model the risk of lower efficiency in those regions.",
